# Regenerable intermediate results for research/selection_v2/run.py.
# 74 sweeps x 6 folds x 18 cells, ~93 MB. Safe to delete: the script recomputes
# everything (~50 min at 3 workers, ~35 min at 5).
#
# v1's cache at research/_selection_study/ is NOT gitignored and is read-only
# input to this study — it holds the engine-d93815344bd3 sweeps that §7's diff
# table is measured against. Do not delete it; re-running v1's script would
# produce sweeps on the CURRENT engine and silently destroy the diff base.
_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Keep the provenance-stamped JSON and the log: they are the evidence that the
# report was produced, and they are small.
!*.json
!*.log
